Interoperability facts without reused data
  The following were read for wire formats and file locations only; nothing
  from them is included: Agent Beacon (asymptote-labs/agent-beacon; the name
  of its hook binary, so spoor can recognise its handler),
  johnlindquist/cursor-hooks (src/types.ts) and 1Password/agent-hooks
  (adapters/) for Cursor hook payloads and replies, Endor Labs'
  endorlabs/mdm-scripts for managed hook locations, and the documentation
  and source code of Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, GitHub Copilot CLI,
  osquery, Fleet and Fluent Bit.


